<section class="pc-section-v3 pc-feedback-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pc-feedback-grid">
      {%- for i in (1..3) -%}
        {%- capture quote_key -%}home_feedback_{{ i }}_quote{%- endcapture -%}
        {%- capture author_key -%}home_feedback_{{ i }}_author{%- endcapture -%}
        {%- capture enable_key -%}home_feedback_{{ i }}_enable{%- endcapture -%}
        {%- if settings[enable_key] -%}
        <div class="pc-feedback-card">
          {%- comment -%} L03b32 (03/11/2026): gỡ Font Awesome (fa-star ×5) — ui_icon star-filled 20px. Glyph FA rộng 1.125em + letter-spacing 2px (không áp cho SVG); .pc-home-v3 .pc-portal * reset margin/padding (0,2,0) ⇒ bước sao giữ bằng space-x (0,3,0): space-x-px < 768, space-x-0.5 ≥ 768; align-text-top + hộp h-5 / md:h-6 items-center đặt tâm sao giữa dòng như glyph cũ mà không đổi cao dòng. {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="pc-feedback-stars space-x-px md:space-x-0.5"><i class="inline-flex h-5 items-center align-text-top md:h-6" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'ui_icon', name: 'star-filled' %}</i><i class="inline-flex h-5 items-center align-text-top md:h-6" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'ui_icon', name: 'star-filled' %}</i><i class="inline-flex h-5 items-center align-text-top md:h-6" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'ui_icon', name: 'star-filled' %}</i><i class="inline-flex h-5 items-center align-text-top md:h-6" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'ui_icon', name: 'star-filled' %}</i><i class="inline-flex h-5 items-center align-text-top md:h-6" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'ui_icon', name: 'star-filled' %}</i></div>
          <p class="pc-feedback-quote">"{{ settings[quote_key] | default: '' }}"</p>
          <span class="pc-feedback-author">— {{ settings[author_key] | default: '' }}</span>
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
